{"sha": "e75d7f7e275cb96d384f6d11b7060e26aec12d1c667e622cd41b1d56d755452a", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "$\\dd h/\\dd t = \\sum_i(\\ddot q_ip_i + \\dot q_i\\dot p_i) -", "\\sum_i(\\partial_{q_i}L\\,\\dot q_i + \\partial_{\\dot q_i}L\\,\\ddot q_i) -", "\\partial_tL$。$\\ddot q_i$ 项相消，欧拉–拉格朗日方程", "将 $\\dot p_i$ 化为 $\\partial_{q_i}L$，从而消去下一对项；", "仅余 $-\\partial_tL$。若 $E_k = \\tfrac12\\sum a_{jk}(q)\\dot", "q_j\\dot q_k$，由二次型的欧拉恒等式可得 $\\sum\\dot", "q_i\\,\\partial E_k/\\partial\\dot q_i = 2E_k$，故 $h = 2E_k - (E_k - E_p)", "= E_k + E_p$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[旋转圆环守恒 $h$，而非 $E$]\\label{ex:b3:lagrangian-mechanics:hoop-energy}", "对\\cref{ex:b3:lagrangian-mechanics:hoop}中的小珠，$L$ 不显含", "$t$，故 $h = \\tfrac12 mR^2\\dot\\theta^2 + U_{\\text{有效}}", "(\\theta)$ 守恒——但机械能 $E = \\tfrac12", "mR^2\\dot\\theta^2 + \\tfrac12 m\\omega^2R^2\\sin^2\\theta - mgR\\cos\\theta$", "不守恒：$E = h + m\\omega^2R^2\\sin^2\\theta$ 随小珠滑动而变化。", "二者之差即为维持 $\\omega$ 恒定的电动机所做的功，", "而小珠到转轴的距离在变化。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{带电粒子与小振动}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[带电粒子的拉格朗日量]\\label{prop:b3:lagrangian-mechanics:charge}", "\\index{速度相关势}", "在由标势 $V$ 与", "矢势 $\\vect A$ 描述的电磁场中（其中 $\\vect E = -\\vect\\nabla V - \\partial_t\\vect A$ 及", "$\\vect B = \\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}\\vect A$，如本科二年级分册", "所述），拉格朗日量", "\\[", "L = \\tfrac12 m\\vect v^{\\,2} - qV + q\\,\\vect v\\cdot\\vect A", "\\]", "通过欧拉–拉格朗日方程，恰好给出洛伦兹", "力 $m\\dot{\\vect v} = q(\\vect E + \\vect v\\wedge\\vect B)$。", "磁力不做功，亦不对应普通的势能，它", "通过一个关于速度的线性项进入；", "共轭动量变为 $\\vect p = m\\vect v + q\\vect A$，", "不再仅为 $m\\vect v$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $x$ 分量：$p_x = m\\dot x + qA_x$，且", "$\\partial_xL = -q\\,\\partial_xV + q\\,\\vect v\\cdot\\partial_x\\vect A$。", "欧拉–拉格朗日方程给出 $m\\ddot x = -q\\,\\partial_xV -", "q\\,\\dd A_x/\\dd t + q\\,\\vect v\\cdot\\partial_x\\vect A$。沿运动", "$\\dd A_x/\\dd t = \\partial_tA_x + (\\vect v\\cdot\\vect\\nabla)A_x$，故", "$m\\ddot x = qE_x + q\\big[\\vect v\\cdot\\partial_x\\vect A - (\\vect v\\cdot", "\\vect\\nabla)A_x\\big]$，且括号项是 $x$ 分量，即 $\\vect", "v\\wedge(\\vect\\nabla\\wedge\\vect A) = \\vect v\\wedge\\vect B$——请展开", "两式以验证。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[小振动与简正模]\\label{prop:b3:lagrangian-mechanics:modes}", "\\index{简正模}\\index{小振动}", "在稳定平衡 $q^{\\text{平衡}}$ 附近，将 $L$ 展开到二阶，", "关于位移 $u_i = q_i - q_i^{\\text{平衡}}$：", "$L \\approx \\tfrac12\\sum m_{ij}\\dot u_i\\dot u_j -", "\\tfrac12\\sum k_{ij}u_iu_j$，矩阵皆为常数对称矩阵。", "运动方程是线性的，任一运动都是", "\\emph{简正模}的叠加：集体振荡 $u_i(t) = a_i\\cos(\\Omega t", "+ \\phi)$，其中所有坐标以同一个频率振动，", "振幅与频率满足 $\\sum_j(k_{ij} -", "\\Omega^2m_{ij})\\,a_j = 0$——矩阵本征值问题，共有 $n$", "个简正模，对应 $n$ 个自由度。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "线性项在平衡处为零；二次型 $L$ 的欧拉–拉格朗日方程", "为 $\\sum_jm_{ij}\\ddot u_j = -\\sum_jk_{ij}u_j$。", "代入试探振动解，得所述线性方程组，其", "有非零振幅矢量，仅当 $\\det(k_{ij} -", "\\Omega^2m_{ij}) = 0$：共 $n$ 个 $\\Omega^2$ 值，", "均在稳定平衡处为正。一般运动可表为简正模的叠加，", "这一结论是对一对二次型作对角化的结果，", "源自本科二年级数学分册中的线性代数；完备性", "在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[由弹簧耦合的两个单摆]\\label{ex:b3:lagrangian-mechanics:coupled}", "两个相同的单摆（质量 $m$，摆长 $\\ell$），其摆球", "由劲度系数为 $k$ 的弹簧相连，两摆竖直悬挂时弹簧处于原长。小", "角度时，", "\\[", "L = \\tfrac12 m\\ell^2(\\dot\\theta_1^2 + \\dot\\theta_2^2)", " - \\tfrac12 mg\\ell(\\theta_1^2 + \\theta_2^2)", " - \\tfrac12 k\\ell^2(\\theta_2 - \\theta_1)^2 .", "\\]", "由对称性可取组合 $s = \\theta_1 + \\theta_2$ 与 $d =", "\\theta_1 - \\theta_2$，二者使方程解耦：\\emph{同相", "模}（$\\theta_1 = \\theta_2$，弹簧无形变）的频率为 $\\Omega_1 =", "\\sqrt{g/\\ell}$，以及 \\emph{反向模}（$\\theta_1 = -\\theta_2$，", "弹簧伸长加倍）的频率为 $\\Omega_2 = \\sqrt{g/\\ell + 2k/m}$。令其中一", "摆单独起振——即两简正模的等量混合——则能量", "完全从一摆转移到另一摆，又回到原摆，往复频率为拍频", "$(\\Omega_2 - \\Omega_1)/2\\pi$：耦合摆", "演示，也是每一种共振能量传递背后的机制，", "从调谐电路到分子振动。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >=Stealth]", "  % in-phase mode", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\draw[thick] (-0.4,0) -- (3.4,0);", "    \\foreach \\i in {-0.2,0.3,0.8,1.3,1.8,2.3,2.8} \\draw (\\i,0) -- (\\i+0.18,0.16);", "    \\fill (0.5,0) circle (1.2pt);", "    \\fill (2.5,0) circle (1.2pt);", "    \\draw[thick] (0.5,0) -- ++(-75:1.9) coordinate (a1);", "    \\draw[thick] (2.5,0) -- ++(-75:1.9) coordinate (a2);", "    \\fill[omDef] (a1) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\fill[omDef] (a2) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\draw[decorate, decoration={coil, aspect=0.6, segment length=3pt, amplitude=2pt}] (a1) -- (a2);", "    \\draw[->, omDef] ($(a1)+(0.05,-0.3)$) -- ++(0.5,0);", "    \\draw[->, omDef] ($(a2)+(0.05,-0.3)$) -- ++(0.5,0);", "    \\node at (1.5,-2.9) {同相：$\\Omega_1 = \\sqrt{g/\\ell}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % opposed mode", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.4cm]", "    \\draw[thick] (-0.4,0) -- (3.4,0);", "    \\foreach \\i in {-0.2,0.3,0.8,1.3,1.8,2.3,2.8} \\draw (\\i,0) -- (\\i+0.18,0.16);", "    \\fill (0.5,0) circle (1.2pt);", "    \\fill (2.5,0) circle (1.2pt);", "    \\draw[thick] (0.5,0) -- ++(-105:1.9) coordinate (b1);", "    \\draw[thick] (2.5,0) -- ++(-75:1.9) coordinate (b2);", "    \\fill[omThm] (b1) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\fill[omThm] (b2) circle (2.6pt);", "    \\draw[decorate, decoration={coil, aspect=0.6, segment length=5pt, amplitude=2pt}] (b1) -- (b2);", "    \\draw[->, omThm] ($(b1)+(-0.05,-0.3)$) -- ++(-0.5,0);", "    \\draw[->, omThm] ($(b2)+(0.05,-0.3)$) -- ++(0.5,0);", "    \\node at (1.5,-2.9) {反向：$\\Omega_2 = \\sqrt{g/\\ell + 2k/m}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}